title: Party Organizations
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs
view-if: party_organizations_timer <= 0
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; party_organizations_timer = 6;
card-image: img/Mann_der_Arbeit.jpg
max-visits: 6
#subtitle: Outside of electoral politics, the SPD runs a social world onto itself.

= Party Organizations

In addition to being a political party, the KPD is a social world onto itself, with a vast array of associated organizations which serve the social needs of their members from cradle to grave.

- @newspapers: Fund more newspapers and journalists.
- @welfare: Fund more mutual aid and welfare programs.
- @culture: Fund atistic and cultural programs.
- @rb: Fund the RFB, our self-defense organization.
- @youth: Support the youth organizations.
- @nothing: Do not increase funding for any program.
- @easy_discard

@newspapers
choose-if: resources > 0
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
subtitle: -1 resources
on-arrival: resources -= 1; media_timer = 0;
go-to: media

# TODO: differing outcomes based on whether you've seen media, and what kind of media you've supported.


@welfare
choose-if: resources > 0
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
subtitle: -1 resources
on-arrival: resources -= 1; workers_aid += 1; unemployed_kpd += 5*(1 - dissent);

We have increased funding to Red Aid Germany and International Workers' Relief. [? if black_thursday_seen > 0 : In an age of economic crisis, this will be helpful for improving our standing among the unemployed. ?]

@culture
choose-if: resources > 0
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
subtitle: -1 resources
on-arrival: resources -= 1; cultural_organizations += 1; ultra-left_dissent -= 6; left-opposition_dissent -= 6; conciliator_dissent -= 6; right_dissent -= 6

It is not enough for the KPD to solely be a political party. We have increased funding for the Association of Revolutionary Visual Artists of Germany, Worker's Theater Movement, and Marxist Workers' School. Funding these organizations makes our members more committed to the party, even when our policies might not be to their liking.

[? if sa_strength > 500 : However, it feels frivolous to spend on art and choirs when the fascists are murdering us in the streets. ?]

@rfb
choose-if: resources > 0
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
subtitle: -1 resources
on-arrival: resources -= 1; rfb_strength  += 100; rfb_militancy += 0.01; funded_rfb += 1

We have increased recruiting to the RFB.

@youth
choose-if: resources > 0
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
subtitle: -1 resources
on-arrival: resources -= 1; rfb_strength += 50; rfb_militancy += 0.02; young_communists += 1; ultra-left_strength += 5; radicalization += 1;

Our new youth members flock to the ultra-left wing of the party and the RFB, bringing with them a fiery revolutionary spirit.

@nothing

We do not fund any party organizations.

- @return: Continue...
